      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"SortArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"SortArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.web\">SortArgumentResolver</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must have previously been passed to\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must have returned true.</dd>\n<dd><code>mavContainer</code> - the ModelAndViewContainer for the current request</dd>\n<dd><code>webRequest</code> - the current request</dd>\n<dd><code>binderFactory</code> - a factory for creating <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instances</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the resolved argument value</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\" title=\"org.springframework.web.method.support 中的类或接口\">resolveArgument</a></code> 接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.web.method.support 中的类或接口\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"SortArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">resolveArgument</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"SortArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web 中的接口\">SortArgumentResolver</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"org.springframework.web.method.support 中的类或接口\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该方法必须返回 true。</dd>\n<dd><code>mavContainer</code> - 当前请求的 ModelAndViewContainer</dd>\n<dd><code>webRequest</code> - 当前请求</dd>\n<dd><code>binderFactory</code> - 用于创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"org.springframework.web.bind 中的类或接口\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的工厂</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>解析后的参数值</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
